				"type": "string",
				"required": true,
				"description": "The revision whose commit supplies every plan, design, approval, thread and image read; planRead passes it unchanged to git ls-tree, git log and git show and does not resolve names itself, so a value Git cannot read rejects with git-failed. Callers in this package pass a full commit id from revision() or from a write result.",
